_inbox" target="_blank">Facebook Business Inbox</a><a class="btn ig" href="http://$SERVER_IP:$API_PORT/api/open/instagram_direct" target="_blank">Instagram Direct</a><a class="btn tt" href="http://$SERVER_IP:$API_PORT/api/open/tiktok_messages" target="_blank">TikTok Messages</a></div></div></body></html>
